name "Enum Names"

target "text"
ast-set "cpp"

constant "note" "Generated by CodeShaper, in the enum's order"
variable "type"
variable "suffix" default="Names"

description r#"Enum Names
==========

This example adds an array with the names of an enum's variants after each enum. The names are collected
from the enum itself, the type of the array is set in the configuration and the end of its name has a default"#
